writeMoons rationale "The failure has nowhere to be reported, so it is discarded"
writeMoons in main
writeMoons invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeMoons argument value Int64 moons copy
writeMoons result none
writeMoons ownedBy none
writeMoons cleanedBy none
writeMoons borrows none
writeMoons catch writeMoonsError console.WriteError
writeMoons suppresses console.WriteError.failed

