addMoons in main
addMoons invokes math.addInt64
addMoons argument left Int64 total copy
addMoons argument right Int64 moons copy
addMoons result nextTotal Int64
addMoons ownedBy none
addMoons cleanedBy none
addMoons borrows none
addMoons catch none
addMoons suppresses none

