writeRows suppresses console.WriteError.failed

readSecond is call
readSecond in main
readSecond invokes planets.rowAt
readSecond argument position Int64 two copy
readSecond result second Planet
readSecond ownedBy none
readSecond cleanedBy none
readSecond borrows none
readSecond catch readSecondError list.IndexOutOfRange
readSecond suppresses none

