readSecondName in main
readSecondName invokes Planet.name
readSecondName argument record Planet second lend
readSecondName result secondName String
readSecondName ownedBy none
readSecondName cleanedBy none
readSecondName borrows second
readSecondName catch none
readSecondName suppresses none

