readSecondKind in main
readSecondKind invokes Planet.kind
readSecondKind argument record Planet second lend
readSecondKind result secondKind Kind
readSecondKind ownedBy none
readSecondKind cleanedBy none
readSecondKind borrows none
readSecondKind catch none
readSecondKind suppresses none

